- **PROXY HARDENED (decision 0037).** The player's wallet token no longer
  reaches the publisher; an oversized publisher answer is refused instead of
  truncated mid-bundle; upstream errors close their connection; a document's
  `<base>` is repaired whatever way the publisher spells it; client patches
  only touch script; the bridge config cannot close its own `<script>` and the
  HUD survives a body-less document; `HEAD` answers instead of 501.
